WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.203
- So, I hate to tell you this,

00:00:01.203 --> 00:00:02.460
but it seems like the Trump Campaign

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.360
might not have been on the level.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.590
Thousands are claiming
that they were scammed

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:07.830
out of millions of dollars

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.370
because they went to donate
to the Trump Campaign,

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.740
but instead of the Trump Campaign
taking only one donation,

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.570
it actually took a series
of recurring donations.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.890
And looking at the language,

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.090
you can see why someone would be confused

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:23.284
that if you didn't uncheck a
box that was already checked,

00:00:23.284 --> 00:00:25.420
it would lead to more recurring

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.020
or at least multiple donations.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:27.853
And the part that says

00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:30.060
that there is a recurring
transaction is actually smaller

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.680
than the rest of the text.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.760
Many are claiming that this
is an unfair business practice

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.320
and that they were scamming
people out of money.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.010
And it's no surprise that many thousands

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.717
of people were able to get refunds

00:00:38.717 --> 00:00:40.840
as a result of these practices.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.970
We'll see if this leads to
more inquiries than just that.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:45.853
And we'll see you in court.

